			"to": "ai/logic-theorist",
			"why": "The Logic Theorist proved theorems of Principia Mathematica in 1956, and its makers predicted in 1958 that a computer would soon prove an important new theorem; the four colour theorem of 1976 was the first major one that needed a computer."
